;     '{"collections":["sentinel-1-rtc"],"bbox":[13.3,52.4,13.5,52.6],"datetime":"2024-06-26T00:00:00Z/2024-06-26T23:59:59Z","limit":1}' \
;     https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/api/stac/v1/search
; (s1_page1.http), the same with page 1's next body (s1_page2.http), and
;   curl -sS -i https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/api/sas/v1/token/sentinel1euwestrtc/sentinel1-grd-rtc
; (token.http), its token's sig= value replaced by REDACTED and its
; content-length changed to match.

